# AI Habit Coach: environment variables.
# Copy this file to .env and set the value. Never commit a real .env.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the JS bundle at build time, so they are
# NOT secret. Never put tokens or passwords here. After changing .env,
# restart Expo with: npx expo start -c
#
# Backend base URL, with no trailing slash. Pick one:
#   Android emulator (backend on this computer):  http://10.0.2.2:8000
#   iOS simulator (backend on this computer):     http://localhost:8000
#   Physical device (same Wi-Fi):                 http://<computer-LAN-IP>:8000
#   Production (Render, may take ~90 s to wake):  https://ai-habit-coach-6vmk.onrender.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
